ocess.\",\"Worldcoin participates in the\":\"Worldcoin participates in the\",\"Yes\":\"Yes\",\"You can withdraw your consent at any time by emailing\":\"You can withdraw your consent at any time by emailing\",\"You must agree to the terms and conditions\":\"You must agree to the terms and conditions\",\"you must agree to the terms\":\"you must agree to the terms\",\"Your answer\":\"Your answer\",\"Your browser does not support the video tag\":\"Your browser does not support the video tag.\",\"Your email\":\"Your email\",\"Your full name\":\"Your full name\",\"Your LinkedIn (if available)\":\"Your LinkedIn (if available)\",\"Page Not Found\":\"Page Not Found\",\"Be first to know\":\"Be first to know about the thinking, ideas and technology behind a more human economic system\",\"Whitepaper\":\"Whitepaper\",\"World Foundation\":\"World Foundation\",\"Worldcoin\":\"Worldcoin\",\"Policy\":\"Policy\",\"Privacy\":\"Privacy\",\"Blog\":\"Blog\",\"Careers\":\"Careers\",\"Community Grants\":\"Community Grants\",\"Cookie Settings\":\"Cookie Settings\",\"Ecosystem\":\"Ecosystem\",\"FAQs\":\"FAQs\",\"Find an Orb\":\"Find an Orb\",\"Get the Orb\":\"Get the Orb\",\"Grants\":\"Grants\",\"Learn Center\":\"Learn Center\",\"Legal Center\":\"Legal Center\",\"Media Center\":\"Media Center\",\"Metrics Definitions\":\"Metrics Definitions\",\"Open Source\":\"Open Source\",\"Orb\":\"Orb\",\"Become an Operator\":\"Become an Operator\",\"World ID\":\"World ID\",\"World App\":\"World App\",\"World Chain\":\"World Chain\",\"About the Orb\":\"About the Orb\",\"About World\":\"About World\",\"Tools\":\"Tools\",\"Developers\":\"Developers\",\"Privacy and Safety\":\"Privacy \u0026 Safety\",\"Socials\":\"Socials\",\"Support\":\"Support\",\"The Orb\":\"The Orb\",\"World Blogs\":\"World Blogs\",\"Footnote\":{\"common\":{\"token_launch\":\"Since token launched on July 24, 2023, i.e., excluding activity during beta phase of project\",\"content\":\"The content speaks only as of the date indicated \u003cstrong\u003eand not all countries listed have active operations.\u003c/strong\u003e Further, it is subject to risks, uncertainties and assumptions, and so may be incorrect and may change without notice. A full disclaimer can be found in our \u003ctermsLink\u003eTerms of Use\u003c/termsLink\u003e and Important User Information can be found on our \u003crisksLink\u003eRisks\u003c/risksLink\u003e page.\",\"eligibility\":\"Eligibility for Worldcoin (WLD) tokens is restricted based on geography, age, and other factors. WLD is not available for distribution via \u003cworldAppLink\u003eWorld App\u003c/worldAppLink\u003e to people, companies or organizations who are residents of, or are located or incorporated in the State of New York or other restricted territories. World Assets, Ltd. and World Foundation are not responsible for the availability of WLD on third party platforms, such as centralized or decentralized exchanges. For details, go to: \u003ctermsLink\u003ehttps://world.org/legal/user-terms-and-conditions\u003c/termsLink\u003e. Crypto products can be highly risky. Important User Information can be found at \u003crisksLink\u003ehttps://world.org/risks\u003c/risksLink\u003e.\"},\"worldusa\":{\"verified_world_id_holders\":\"Verified World ID holders are eligible to claim a portion of this amount each month over the next 12 months. See \u003cuserTermsLink\u003eUser Terms \u0026 Conditions\u003c/userTermsLink\u003e.\"},\"grants\":{\"disclaimer\":\"Grants are not available to, or intended for, people or companies who are residents of, or are located, incorporated or have a registered agent in, the United States or certain other restricted territories. More details can be found in the \u003cdisclaimerLink\u003eHuman Collective Grant Disclaimer\u003c/disclaimerLink\u003e.\",\"tax_responsibility\":\"Grant recipients will be responsible for any tax payable on the grant in their home jurisdiction, as applicable. World Foundation may, at its discretion, choose to make grants directly in USDC or a similar stablecoin type asset, rather than in WLD. This approach provides flexibility to the Foundation to take into account a variety of commercial and regulatory considerations given the global nature of the grants program and the Foundation's objectives of transparency, sustainability and regulatory compliance.\"}},\"Active Orbs\":\"Active Orbs\",\"Countries with World ID users\":\"Countries with World ID users\",\"Daily wallet transactions\":\"Daily wallet transactions\",\"See disclaimer below\":\"See disclaimer below\",\"Tokens distributed\":\"Tokens distributed\",\"Total wallet transactions\":\"Total wallet transactions\",\"Unique humans\":\"Unique humans\",\"Verifications in last 7 days\":\"Verifications in last 7 days\",\"Wallet transactions\":\"Wallet transactions\",\"Community Alerts\":\"Community Alerts\",\"Cookie Policy\":\"Cookie Policy\",\"Data Requests\":\"Data Requests\",\"Get WorldApp\":\"Get World App\",\"New accounts in last 7 days\":\"New accounts in last 7 days\",\"Privacy Notice\":\"Privacy Notice\",\"Risks\":\"Risks\",\"Trademark Policy\":\"Trademark Policy\",\"User Terms\":\"User Terms\",\"World App users\":\"World App users\",\"Blockchains\":\"Blockchains\",\"Credentials\":\"Credentials\",\"Optimism\":\"Optimism\",\"Other Wallets\":\"Other Wallets\",\"Polygon\":\"Polygon\",\"Proof of Personhood Wallets\":\"Proof of Personhood Wallets\",\"World ID Protocol\":\"World ID Protocol\",\"Open sourced\":\"Open sourced\",\"In progress\":\"In progress\",\"state_bridges\":{\"title\":\"State bridges\",\"description\":\"State bridge between the World ID Ethereum mainnet deployment and World ID supported EVM networks.\"},\"main_protocol\":{\"title\":\"Main Protocol\",\"subtitle\":\"Ethereum mainnet\",\"description\":\"Mainnet is the primary public Ethereum production blockchain, where actual-value transactions occur on the distributed ledger.\"},\"sequencer_indexer\":{\"title\":\"Sequencer \u0026 Indexer\",\"description\":\"Service that inserts verified World IDs on-chain (batched) and fetches inclusion proofs to generate ZKPs for World ID.\"},\"world_id_sdk\":{\"title\":\"World ID SDK\",\"description\":\"Set of tools, libraries, APIs, examples and documentation to easily use the World ID Protocol.\"},\"world_app\":{\"title\":\"World App\",\"description\":\"World App is the first app for the Worldcoin ecosystem. Intentionally designed for simplicity and inclusivity.\"},\"metadata_service\":{\"title\":\"Metadata Service\",\"description\":\"The metadata service within Worldcoin's Developer Portal provides a verified source of information for World ID apps and actions.\"},\"uniqueness_service\":{\"title\":\"Uniqueness Service\",\"description\":\"The Uniqueness Service is the system that compares prospective iris codes to ensure only unique humans are added into the verified set of World IDs.\"},\"orb_hardware\":{\"title\":\"Orb Hardware\",\"description\":\"The Orb is a custom privacy-preserving biometric imaging device to provide global, equitable access to Worldcoin via the World ID protocol.\"},\"orb_software\":{\"title\":\"Orb Software\",\"description\":\"The Orb is a custom privacy-preserving biometric imaging device to provide global, equitable access to Worldcoin via the World ID protocol.\"},\"Select country\":\"Select country\",\"Countries range\":\"{from} - {to} of {loc_sum} locations\",\"Events range\":\"{from} - {to} of {total} events\",\"Self serve\":\"Self-serve\",\"Assisted\":\"Assisted\",\"Show on Map\":\"Show on Map\",\"Book on World App\":\"Book on World App\",\"Play\":\"Play\",\"Banner title\":\"The case for Proof of Human on Moltbook\",\"See more\":\"See more\",\"See less\":\"See less\",\"All\":\"All\",\"Transactions\":\"Transactions\",\"Transactions Today\":\"Transactions Today\",\"Active Wallets\":\"Active Wallets\",\"Active Wallets Today\":\"Active Wallets Today\",\"Trading Volume Today\":\"Trading Volume Today\",\"Trading Volume\":\"Trading Volume\",\"Day\":\"Day\",\"Week\":\